            <title>0.15.26</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 14:06:03 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>187</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.26</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>The menu-bar icon no longer intermittently clips to &quot;( )&quot;. The idle ring was an SF Symbol whose rendered size sat at the menu-bar height limit, so macOS clipped its top and bottom (instead of scaling) whenever it re-laid-out the status item — on display sleep/wake, external-monitor connect/disconnect, or fullscreen transitions. It&#x27;s now a fixed-size ring drawn the same way as the recording dot (which never clipped), and the button scales any icon down rather than clipping it.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
